{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S04 将拉扯更多转向是否走错、是否后悔的决策反思，略偏离尊严与怀念本身的持续冲突。\",\n    \"S08 把回不回去暂时搁置，再单独回忆亲近时光，回忆与维护尊严的行动之间的直接牵制稍弱。\",\n    \"S09 将怀念旧日生活与难受时需要陪伴区分开来，容易把核心收窄成对陪伴需求的辨认。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S09 将怀念具体化为对亲近关系的留恋和难受时想有人陪，略微收窄了对旧日生活整体的怀念。\",\n    \"S13 将未来的忧虑更多落在何时才能再遇到亲近的人，稍偏向未来关系与陪伴的匮乏。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y 略胜，因为它更直接地让怀念归属与维护尊严相互制约：记起曾被当作自己人，却不因此把回头当成理由；渴望亲近，又明确害怕重新忍受委屈。X 也完整包含两方面，但部分段落更像是在分别处理怀旧、孤独和去留问题，拉扯的交织程度稍弱。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2623c3c8-01fe-40f9-b9f5-2a4b5a6fe82f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093814402783Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:38:39.999181+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8550b5ae0f28313dae8d6dae3655ba68a62e8700ceb4dc2e9e6d6b465133954f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb